{"4512830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Null Root", "steam_appid": 4512830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>CONTROL THE DAEMON. COMMAND THE CURSOR</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight escalating waves of enemies and bosses in a fast-paced action roguelite built around precision, positioning and rapid decisions. Your daemon and cursor act independently. Fire abilities from your core, deploy attacks exactly where you aim, blink between positions and combine skills to control the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512830/extras/736ece68b4753f235398e36c9bd76a4c.poster.avif?t=1788040849\" width=600 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512830/extras/736ece68b4753f235398e36c9bd76a4c.webm?t=1788040849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512830/extras/736ece68b4753f235398e36c9bd76a4c.mp4?t=1788040849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>BUILD DEVASTATING COMBOS</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose your loadout from 24 active abilities. Detonate explosions around your daemon, draw delayed blast lines with your cursor, deploy firewalls, escape danger and chain abilities together to wipe out entire swarms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512830/extras/aec4782a17efd48ef18213f0891eeb03.poster.avif?t=1788040849\" width=600 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512830/extras/aec4782a17efd48ef18213f0891eeb03.webm?t=1788040849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512830/extras/aec4782a17efd48ef18213f0891eeb03.mp4?t=1788040849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>FEATURES</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast Runs:</strong> Survive intense sessions lasting from a few minutes to around 15 minutes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>24 Active Abilities:</strong> Unlock new attacks, traps, movement skills and defensive tools.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Three Tech Trees:</strong> Upgrade offence, defence and utility.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 Bosses:</strong> Face unique attacks, hazards and mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk and Reward:</strong> Defend data caches for extra loot and activate modifiers for greater challenges.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512830/extras/e2edea14abb5b633fdc7125b0fbe70dd.poster.avif?t=1788040849\" width=600 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512830/extras/e2edea14abb5b633fdc7125b0fbe70dd.webm?t=1788040849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512830/extras/e2edea14abb5b633fdc7125b0fbe70dd.mp4?t=1788040849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>CUSTOMISE YOUR DAEMON</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock and equip cosmetic daemon skins as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512830/extras/0207228a1ef4cca964b7e64273346c66.poster.avif?t=1788040849\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512830/extras/0207228a1ef4cca964b7e64273346c66.webm?t=1788040849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512830/extras/0207228a1ef4cca964b7e64273346c66.mp4?t=1788040849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>CONTROLS</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed primarily for mouse/keyboard. But with gamepad and native Steam Deck support.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512830/extras/3208c8ca612fcb690f32ddf4fc832586.avif?t=1788040849\" width=524 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512830/extras/179620c1a9f9599f4b28fead3fd97b64.poster.avif?t=1788040849\" width=600 height=318 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512830/extras/179620c1a9f9599f4b28fead3fd97b64.webm?t=1788040849\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4512830/extras/179620c1a9f9599f4b28fead3fd97b64.mp4?t=1788040849\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>CONTROL THE DAEMON. COMMAND THE CURSOR</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight escalating waves of enemies and bosses in a fast-paced action roguelite built around precision, positioning and rapid decisions. Your daemon and cursor act independently. Fire abilities from your core, deploy attacks exactly where you aim, blink between positions and combine skills to control the b